#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_Intro
Hello, hello! I am the\nName Rater.\pWould you like me to rate one\nof your Pok\emon's nicknames?

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_ChooseMon
Which Pok\emon's nickname\nshould I rate?

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_Rename
[BUFFER1], is it?\pThat is a fine nickname.\nWould you like a nicer one?

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_NewName
What shall the new nickname be?

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_Unchanged
Very well. [BUFFER1] it remains.

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_Changed
Done! From now on, this Pok\emon\nshall be known as [BUFFER1].

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_Egg
That is merely an Egg.\pIt has no nickname for me\nto rate.

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_TradeMon
That nickname is already quite\nimpeccable.\pI cannot change a name given\nby another Trainer.

#org @gText_PokeCenterNameRater_No
I see.\pDo visit again if a nickname\nstarts to itch.
